 de carga a un lado y</c></f></p><p style="Normal"><f family="Arial" charset="0" size="10"><c val="#253746">se reparte entre sus tres M5; apertura y palanca usan 1,5. Toda carga P se suma al tornillo</c></f></p><p style="Normal"><f family="Arial" charset="0" size="10"><c val="#253746">y se resta a la compresión para cubrir por separado extremos de reparto elástico.</c></f></p></text></region><region region-id="460" left="16" top="23510.59" width="490" height="20" align-x="16" align-y="23523.59" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="texto"><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal"><f family="Arial" charset="0" size="9"><b><c val="#687A88">SEDAC / P2.03 / MC02</c></b></f></p></text></region><region region-id="461" left="16" top="23536.59" width="490" height="28" align-x="16" align-y="23554.79" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="texto"><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal"><f family="Arial" charset="0" size="14"><b><c val="#123B54">19. Vástago liso en los planos de carga</c></b></f></p></text></region><region region-id="462" left="16" top="23570.59" width="330" height="48" align-x="16" align-y="23601.79" show-border="false" show-highlight="true" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="#F0F6FC" tag="As6"><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve">As6</ml:id><ml:apply><ml:mult/><ml:real>20.1</ml:real><ml:apply><ml:pow/><ml:id xml:space="preserve">mm</ml:id><ml:real>2</ml:real></ml:apply></ml:apply></ml:define></math></region><region region-id="463" left="355" top="23570.59" width="150" height="48" align-x="355" align-y="23601.79" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="eval_As6"><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ml:eva